[0.000, "o", "\u001b[32m\u001b[39m\r\n\u001b[32m✓ Lobu initialized!\u001b[39m\r\n\u001b[32m\u001b[39m\r\n"]
[0.000, "o", "\u001b[1mNext steps:\u001b[22m\r\n\u001b[1m\u001b[22m\r\n"]
[0.000, "o", "\u001b[36m  1. cd my-agent\u001b[39m\r\n\u001b[36m  2. Start the local stack: lobu run (uses PGlite by default)\u001b[39m\r\n\u001b[2m       Optional: set DATABASE_URL in .env to use external Postgres instead.\u001b[22m\r\n\u001b[36m  3. Link the project to Lobu Cloud and register it: lobu login && lobu org set <slug> && lobu apply\u001b[39m\r\n\u001b[2m       Then `lobu run` will print a short-lived Slack Preview link code.\u001b[22m\r\n\u001b[36m  4. API docs: http://localhost:8787/api/docs\u001b[39m\r\n"]
[0.000, "o", "\u001b[2m\u001b[22m\r\n\u001b[2m  See README.md for layout, AGENTS.md for the agent contract.\u001b[22m\r\n\u001b[2m\u001b[22m\r\n"]
